State the output of the following program segment for each value of x:
if (++x == 11) {
    System.out.print("RESULT IS 11");
} else if (++x == 10) {
    System.out.print("RESULT IS 10");
} else if (--x == 10) {
    System.out.print("RESULT IS 10");
} else {
    System.out.print("RESULT IS NEITHER 10 NOR 11");
}
(i) x = 9
(ii) x = 10
(iii) x = 11
(iv) x = 12

State the output of the following program segment for each value of num:
switch (num) {
    case 10:
    case 100:
        System.out.println("original" + num);
        ++num;
    case 1000:
    case 500:
        ++num;
    default:
        --num;
        System.out.print("Final" + num);
}
(i) num = 10
(ii) num = 100
(iii) num = 0
(iv) num = 500
